WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.100
Put one drop of black ink on a pencil
line near the bottom of a paper strip.

2
00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:10.320
Stand the strip in solvent, just below
the line, and watch the solvent creep up.

3
00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.820
The black spot pulls apart into separate
dyes, each ending at a different height.

4
00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.140
Same drop, same paper, same solvent.

5
00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:22.300
So why do the dyes travel
different distances?

6
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:25.020
In this mission, you'll run
a chromatogram properly,

7
00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:28.460
and see why the start
line is drawn in pencil.

8
00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:31.320
Then you'll take the same
separation into a column,

9
00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:35.260
where each part of a mixture
comes out at its own time.

10
00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:40.050
Your mission: explain why the dyes travel
different distances up the paper.